  "exact_zero_temperature_formula": "For bipartite hopping H the spectrum is \u00b1 paired, so at mu=0 the spinless grand ground energy is F_infinity(H)=-(1/2) Tr|H|. This does not establish an all-beta free-energy inequality; the seven nontrivial pi corners are preferred numerically at listed finite betas and at zero temperature.",
